Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:27.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《惊声尖笑5》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:34.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警方于3月15日发现了查理的尸体）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:39.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（他的遗体直到23日才停止活塞运动）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:48.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警方正在搜寻查理失踪了的三个孩子 出于习惯他们逮捕了林德熙·罗翰）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.66,0:44:13.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（啊哦 技术故障请 请不要走开）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.77,1:00:44.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（千万别看）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.58,1:00:47.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（绝对是个坏主意）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你和每个姑娘都录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't want to make one of these tapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我还是算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it's something you do with every girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个姑娘 当然不会 我可不是冠希老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every girl? No, no. I am strictly a one-woman guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想自导自演艳照门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't want to end up all over the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直是以低调自诩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pride myself on keeping a low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的私生活绝不张扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}My private life is private.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我以为你从来没拍过 这些是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I thought you never did this before. What are all these?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那些只是我借来的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, just some movies I rented.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我和布兰迪 传教士体位」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Me and Brandy, Missionary"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是关于两个女孩成为尼姑的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tale of two girls who become nuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我和布兰迪 狗趴式」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Me and Brandy, Doggy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是续集 讲的是尼姑们养了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sequel. The nuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.79,0:00:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只棕色拉布拉多\N{\fnArial\fs30}adopt a chocolate lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are all those?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那些是标准的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's just your standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,家用安保设备 很常见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}home security setup. Basic run-of-the mill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的 很多家庭都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No big deal, nothing too elaborate. Everybody has them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么都对着你的床\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why do you need security cameras pointing at your bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防小偷偷我的性爱录像带\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case a burglar tries to steal my sex tapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:00:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上床吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's get into bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要速战速决 我明早还要出席一个庭审\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just make this quick. I have a court hearing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨德森法官主持的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judge Henderson?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 是他就好了 是汤姆森\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I wish. Thompson.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那你有得好受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. That's going to suck for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于驾驶事故的 小事一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a driving mishap thingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.36,0:01:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我个忙好吗 保证你再也不开车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor. Promise me you won't drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.44,0:01:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真好 你是在担心我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's sweet. You're worried about me driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.48,0:01:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在担心我自己 我可是行人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-mm. I'm worried about me. I'm a pedestrian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.36,0:01:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 是我的提神醒脑器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. That's my sobriety monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是绑在脚踝上的跟踪脚环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ankle. Tracking bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 等等 抱歉 是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait. Wait. Sorry, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这尼玛谁弄的 - 我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who put that on you? - I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用这样我才能够满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way I can have an orgasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚会是例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 在热身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… warming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定房子里就我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure we're alone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.12,0:02:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,总觉得这里还有别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels like there's somebody else in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是… 有人在放旧软管而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… unraveling the old hose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天再收拾吧 劳尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it for tomorrow, Raul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.96,0:02:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好滴 先森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si, senor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,爽死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. That was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 艾米丽奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here, Emilio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我好怕怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,林德熙 亲爱的 没什么可怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lindsay, sweetie, there's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这有事 晚点再打给你 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I got the stuff. I got to call you back, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我还是走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的要走 明天再来好不好 你很忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? How about tomorrow? You busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要干翻你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to blow you across the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.16,0:04:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,碉堡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事就此开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thus our story begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,悬赏查理孩子的大笔赏金\N{\fnArial\fs30}The large reward offered for the rescue of Charlie's kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:05:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸引了警察 私家侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}drew the attention of police, private detectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及红十字会志愿者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Red Cross volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都急切地搜寻着这几个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone was on high alert for these children,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这两个人除外\N{\fnArial\fs30}except these two guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 伙计 奥巴马医改让老年公民\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, Obamacare gives senior citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够获得更便宜的药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}access to cheaper drugs,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,免费的预防保健\N{\fnArial\fs30}free preventative care,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且弥补了医疗保险处方药计划的漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it closes the Medicare Part D loophole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果把洗发露弄到马眼里了这些又有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how does that help if I get shampoo in my dick hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥 - 你敢说你从来没有把洗发露\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Mean to tell me you ain't never got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弄进去过吗 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- shampoo in your pee hole? - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许有那么一两次 - 是啊 一两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe like once or twice. - Yeah, once or twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你瞎撸的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you was playing with yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我没有瞎撸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wasn't playing with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在洗澡 就一不小心弄进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was showering, and crazy got up in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯淡 牛顿的万有引力定律是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit. Cam Newton's law of gravity is:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那玩意儿不翘起来 肥皂水是进不去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing must be up in order for that soap to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 那真是疼死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, either way, that shit stings like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实很疼 就像里面一只蜜蜂发现自己的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sting like a mother, man, it feel like it's a hornet up in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在和别的男人乱搞 然后猛地蛰了你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he found out his girl be, you know, doing her thing with another man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 我搞不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exactly. - I don't understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.64,0:05:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗发露公司不能处理这个问题 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}the shampoo company can't fix that, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能做出「无泪配方」\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got "No More Tears."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么就不能发明个鸡爽配方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why they can't make no more hornets in your dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们想不到你会把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really think they expect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,无泪洗发露用在鸡巴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to use the No More Tears on your dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们为什么叫强生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why they call it Johnson & Johnson?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个更好的问题 伙计 我们两个大男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a better question, man. What the hell are two stoners doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.48,0:06:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这片阴森森的森林里瞎逛是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}wandering around these spooky-ass woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 会有回报的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's going to be worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你… 这里是洪堡郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you… this is Humboldt County.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是他们种毒品的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where all the growers grow their bomb-ass shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会让我们随便拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they're gonna be cool with us just helping ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用带走整株植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, we ain't taking no plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,剪几片叶子就行 你懂我意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna snip a few buds. You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后叶子就会像龙虾一样重新长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna grow back just like a lobster paw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,植物就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that's how nature do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为 伙计 总觉得不太对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. Just doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会在意的 我们会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, they ain't gonna care. Look, man, we're gonna be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们捞一票 然后就离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna roll one blunt, then we're gonna get up out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一票 - 就一票\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just one? - Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们无所谓吗 - 只管跑 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They won't care, huh? - Man, just keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勒个擦 那是无人机吗 我们不是本拉登啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit. Is that a drone? They're going all Zero Dark Thirty on our ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, I think they gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,树林里有个小屋 我们得过去躲一躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, whoa. It's a cabin in the woods. We need to go hide over in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 伙计 我才不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, man, I'm not going in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我想起我看过的一部恐怖电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}It reminds me of a horror movie I once saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么恐怖电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}What horror movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲树林中有一个小屋的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one with the cabin in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黑色星期五 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Friday the 13th? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是讲树林中有一个小屋的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one with the cabin in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,德州电锯杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Texas Chain Saw Massacre?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 是讲树林中有一个小屋的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the one with the cabin in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,午夜凶铃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是讲树林中有一个小屋的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one with the cabin in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫布莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blair Witch Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.44,0:07:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 伙计 是讲树林中有一个小屋的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, the one with the cabin in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明斯特一家 - 这部不是在树林里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Munsters. - That wasn't in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这部连电影都不算 - 听着 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They wasn't even a damn movie. - Look, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间在这里闲扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}we ain't got time for this shit right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得进树林里那间屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get to that cabin in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他妈是什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来是房屋沉降的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound like the house settling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里看其来挺新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looked new.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去看看 - 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna take a look around. - Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在射什么 - 那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where we shooting? - There.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪个 - 阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - The dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那儿 - 不 是那片阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There? - No, this dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.44,0:07:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨型阿拉斯加帝王蟹刚爬到我身上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big-ass Alaskan king crab just ran up on me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蟹 你找死 - 你试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crab? Cuz, we banging? - Ja'Marcus,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.24,0:08:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把枪放下 伙计 - 你先放 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- put the guns down, man. - Put yours down first, homey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 一起数三 一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, on three. One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,艹 你还想来一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn. You want to try it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 奥 散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uno, dos, tres.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以这样玩一整天 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, we could do this shit all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停战 - 停战\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Truce? - Truce.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪安得雷 你看 只是两个小女孩而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yo, D'Andre. Look, homey. It's two little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是种族主义者 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're little racist girls, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,涂了一脸黑 没关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wearing blackface. Cool with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小妹妹 你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, little girl, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说什么 - 她说「我想尝尝你的腿」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd she say? - She said, "I wonder what your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「不知味道如何」 - 啥 啊 我擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- tastes like." - What? Ah, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小蜘蛛女咬了我一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little spider girl bit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能要有超能力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're going to get superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不是什么黑超人 - 交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ain't no black superheroes. - I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}' Hi-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪安得雷 我觉得她们是新闻里说的失踪女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo. D'Andre, I think they're the missing kids from the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么这么肯定 - 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How can you be so sure? - Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不敢肯定 但如果她们真是失踪儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. Well, if it is the missing kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会拿到一笔奖金 然后给自己买\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take that reward money, and I'm gonna buy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘游艇 装满现金和妹子 再养一条鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}a yacht, fill it with cash, bitches and a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你养鲨鱼做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you want to buy a shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我… 我们会用得上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me… we're gonna need a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回头再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怀孕 别怀孕 别怀孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No baby, no baby, no baby, no baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怀孕了 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're pregnant… - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是爱怀孕测试的数据结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with anticipation over the outcome of this iPregnancy test,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一结果表明…\N{\fnArial\fs30}which has determined that you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,坑爹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没怀孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗运不错 小荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dodged a bullet, you lucky slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, God. Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息 他们找到我哥哥的孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great news: They found my brother's kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是大女儿 凯西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're very fortunate the older one, Kathy, has retained.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,记起了大部分的词汇\N{\fnArial\fs30}most of her vocabulary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,婴儿则一字未说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby hasn't actually said a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.68,0:10:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么会 - 因为他还是个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - Because he's a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经单独待在这三个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been alone here over three long months.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得提醒你们这一切并不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to warn both of you that this is not going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好啊 - 不对 不对 不是这扇窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - No, no. Wrong window.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里才是孩子们的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's where the children are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在干什么 - 为了适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is she doing? - In order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,极度孤立的生活 孩子们想象出了一个守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}their extreme isolation, the girls created an imaginary guardian,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个喂他们吃饭 唱给给他们听的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a parent figure to feed them, sing to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们称她为麻麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call her Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:11:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也许能帮你们有所进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these may help you break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,利他林也能有所帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Ritalin may help, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,适合他们这个年纪的用量是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The proper dosage for someone their age is…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish me luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 凯西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - Kathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 凯西 记得这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, Kathy. Remember these?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前戴的 能帮助你看得更清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to wear them to help you see better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许应该给她配个隐形眼镜 软的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should get her some contacts… the soft kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 亲爱的 我不是你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sweetheart. Not Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的丹叔叔 你还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your Uncle Dan. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是朱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.92,0:11:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱…迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo…dy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.04,0:12:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪 朱和迪中间没有停顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody. No pause between "Jo" and "dy."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱…迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo…dy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 教不会了 带回去养肯定要悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, we're at an impasse. I see constant conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 他们会对你敞开心扉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine. They'll warm up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 小姑娘 不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, little lady, that's not how…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个小娘们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很合我们的心意 医生 他们看着很乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, everything checks out. They seem like good kids, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,报销下我们的停车费 我们带他们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just validate our parking. We'll take them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 事情不是你们想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks, I wish it were that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不给报销\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't validate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你们不能带走那些孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying the kids are not yours to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来没戏了 我们撤吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can't win them all. Let's skedaddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.64,0:12:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没道理 他们是我哥哥查理的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not fair. They're my brother Charlie's kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有合法监护权\N{\fnArial\fs30}We deserve them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你的妻子是朋克摇滚乐手 整夜不着家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you? Your wife plays in a punk rock band, staying out all night long,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.28,0:12:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸毒抽大麻 每晚还和不同男人滚床单\N{\fnArial\fs30}high on drugs, sleeping with a different man every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计法院不会判给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think the courts are gonna look upon that too favorably.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 我只是吓吓你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But… - I was just messing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.52,0:12:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是你们的了 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The kids are yours. - They are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见了吗 亲爱的 他们是我们的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that, honey? They're ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个附加条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}On one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这栋房子归案例研究所所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This house is owned by the Institute for Case Studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,每间房间都装了全方位无死角摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every room is fully wired with cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要搬进房子里才能拥有孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you move into the house, you get the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不能卖了房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we just sell the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把孩子送进高档的孤儿院\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put the kids in a high-end orphanage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪 你真的准备好当妈妈了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody, do you really think you're out to be a mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她当然准备好了 - 丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course she is. - Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后 没有摇滚乐队 没有这蠢假发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, no more rock band, no more silly wig.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢你妹啊 这是我身体的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not silly. It's all a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也没有纹身 - 你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And no more tattoos. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我应该做的 我们是标准的郊区小夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I had to. We're a perfect suburban couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是丹和朱迪带着孩子们向新家出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so Dan and Jody headed to their new house with their new children.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 就像是放完春假回学校的联谊会小骚货\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, like a slutty sorority girl returning from spring break,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也带回了隐藏在背后的罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were also bringing home a hidden evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子们 这是我们的新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, kids, here's our new house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是丹叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's Uncle Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.12,0:13:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 别忘了还有妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Don't forget about mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 我不是他们的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, I'm not their mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以喊我朱迪阿姨\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can call me Aunt Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者阿朱 J妈 桑德斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Jodes, J-Mom, Mrs. Sanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者他们也可以喊我 车库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, if they really want to call me… Garage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是朱迪和艾丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes Jody and Aidan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次踏进家门\N{\fnArial\fs30}entering the house for the very first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是我们好好保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we're going to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让你受任何的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make sure nothing bad…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 艾丹 抱歉 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Aidan! I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们应该把他放在婴儿篮里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should put him in the carrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:13:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 这样好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, see, that's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 艾丹 怎么了 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Aidan. What, what, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放轻松 没事的 - 哦 完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax, it's OK. - Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹 孩子不见了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dan, I lost the baby! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 艾丹 艾丹 你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh, Aidan! Aidan, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾丹 - 他去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aidan! - Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 他在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there he is, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你姐姐凯西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your sister Kathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 艾丹 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Aidan, it's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要用婴儿的语气说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just got to talk in a baby voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说的内容反而不重要 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't even matter what you say. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你继母妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your stepmommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的死鬼妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your fricking mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现不错 你很有天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, you're a natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天 我该怎么办 哦 哦 用这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, what do I do? Oh, oh! Here, this, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯西 哦 抱歉 宝贝 - 哎哟哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kathy! Oh, sorry, honey - Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 完成啦 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, there you go, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是不是有点阴气逼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it chilly in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一进房间就感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it as soon as I entered the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有啊 嘿 这些是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels fine. Hey, what are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:14:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些很有趣 这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is interesting. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:15:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 那是麻麻画的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Mama drew that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 这是我们画的艾丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we drew this picture for Aidan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是艾丹坐着火箭飞向月球\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? It's Aidan on a rocket to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 坐在火箭上 - 莉莉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. Sitting on a rocket. - Where's Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 亲爱的 换一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, sweetie, the other end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把艾丹介绍给其余的家庭成员吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go introduce Aidan to the rest of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这是我们毛茸茸的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and there's our furry family member.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 玛利亚 - 才不是呢 是阿迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Maria. - No, Dan, Artie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.28,0:15:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对 对 我们的爱犬阿迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, of course, our dog Artie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 新宝宝 我来为他祈福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ay, the new baby. I make blessing. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.28,0:15:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 这就够了 玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, OK, that's good, Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,多了三个孩子要养活\N{\fnArial\fs30}With three new kids to care for,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹更需要在工作上有所建树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan really needed to start performing at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:16:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是他和他的同事处得并不顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately he was having some issues with a colleague.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 我有预感你这次能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Caesar, this is the one, I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,八十一秒 哦 凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighty-one seconds? Oh, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你有史以来的最差成绩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your worst time yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.40,0:16:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在创造力测试上的表现更令人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing even worse on your creativity test.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看我用积木搭出来的这些充满创意的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at all the imaginative things I made out of blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如这架飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this awesome plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 你有什么成果了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, do you have any results yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我现在一天给这些灵长动物注射两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, I've been injecting the primates twice a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I-13开智药物 我希望一周以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the I-13 intelligence drug. I'm hoping in a week or so…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望在凯撒身上投入的时间和资金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope Caesar is not just.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有所回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}a big waste of time and money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向董事会汇报的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one responsible to the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.63,0:16:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能给出一个值得期待的前景吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just show me one thing positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.72,0:16:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 他们还在投粪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. They still throw their shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少现在它们开始计分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now they can keep score.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要加快进度了 什么时候能人体试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to kick-start this thing. When can we go to human trials?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快了 但是有一个中间点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're close, but there's an intermediate step.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:17:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果I-13在这些主妇身上起效\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the I-13 works on these reality wives…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好去检查下脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better check that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,切 谁敢检查我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gonna check me, boo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们居然把研究所的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pinning the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,系在未开化的野兽身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our lab on wild beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不是野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们能感知 有自己的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have feelings, they have families.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,雄性站着嘘嘘 雌性蹲着嘘嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Males pee standing up, females pee sitting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些猿和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}These apes are just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也和我一样 你和我 白人和黑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me… you and me, blacks and whites.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 更像白人 我们像是白一点的猿人\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like whites, of course. We whites are a lighter shade of ape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你则是个黑 嘿 我们都有得膀胱炎的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}whereas you are bla… dder infection, we're all at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚才讨论什么来着 木耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what were we talking about again? Vaginas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒必须在董事会上展示些智能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar has got to show some human intelligence at that board meeting…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒恐怕比半数董事都聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar's probably smarter than half of those board members.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹 - 我知道你要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dan… - I know what you're going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要是真的那么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If he's so smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么还会沦落到被关在笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}why is he in a cage?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,被关在笼子里的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.56,0:18:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 你是要这个吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you're looking for this? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的芭蕾娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my ballerina doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你自己做的 - 麻麻做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You made this? - Mama did,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把小木枝 苔藓 蜘蛛网 麻雀骨 蜥蜴眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}using twigs, moss, spiderwebs, sparrow bones, lizard eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用耗子口水黏合 - 哦 恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- all held together with rat droppings. - Oh, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊 你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, ah, ah. What… what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在没法面对那些孩子 他们太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't deal with these kids. They're creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该带他们回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should just take 'em back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你们需要找点共同话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you guys just need to find some common ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.12,0:19:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如凯西不离身的芭蕾娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that ballerina doll Kathy's always playing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想提芭蕾这档事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to talk about the ballet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远忘不了芭蕾对我妈妈的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what the ballet did to my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她太如痴如醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She became obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至在怀着我的时候还参加天鹅湖的演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}She even danced the swan while she was pregnant with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,油 油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boo, ray, boo! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘什么嘘 你个小兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. Hell. You better sit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好在喉咙被揍断前乖乖坐好\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I punch you in your damn throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.52,0:19:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老娘这在看戏呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小子再敢在那边嘘 嘘 小心我削你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go on… shh… shh me again. I double-dog dare you, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不打听打听老娘是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better ask somebody who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.52,0:20:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,传得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈再也没能恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom was never the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事会发生纯属上帝脑子抽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's unlikely to ever happen again, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.52,0:20:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就听我一次呗 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give it a shot. Look what I found earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.00,0:20:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这只是个小制作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I know it's just a local production.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也能成为你和凯西的一点谈资\N{\fnArial\fs30}But could be something for you and Kathy to talk about, could be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真这么想 - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You really think so? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我就去瞅瞅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I suppose I could check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 但是一遇到障碍 我就要放弃的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. But the minute it becomes too difficult, I'm giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这种精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然朱迪回归芭蕾的初衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though Jody only returned to the ballet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是为了亲近女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}to connect with the girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.64,0:20:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是想要成为天鹅皇后的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}as she got closer she couldn't help but get excited at the prospect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,愈来愈强烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}of becoming the Swan Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,本季我们用天鹅湖开场\N{\fnArial\fs30}This season we open with "Swan Lake."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,众所周知 这个选段有着芭蕾舞中\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you all know, this piece has the most challenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最具有挑战性的角色 天鹅女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}and demanding role in all of ballet… the Swan Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄到了不少重量级竞争对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sizing up her competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪已经能闻到腥风血雨的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody knew the battle would be a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,白天鹅和黑天鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The white and the black.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是我们有海瑟·达尔西的加盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately we have with us prima ballerina and the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我们的首席芭蕾舞演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my last 146 productions…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.83,0:21:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我之前所有演出的领舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather Darcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 经验丰富的专业人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the seasoned professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明 执拗 上了年纪 饱经风霜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The still brilliant, crusty, old, weathered,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有着魔鬼脸庞的芭蕾前辈和这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}leather-faced elder statesman of ballet to whom these young girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没经验 美丽诱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}less experienced, more beautiful and delicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是仍然太嫩了的年轻姑娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but still very raw ballerina hopefuls, look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,给这些迷人的孩子们露一手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show these far more desirable children how it's done, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.48,0:21:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:21:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,展示下那招 跳跃后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try that thing where you are skipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,单脚跳再岔开双腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you hop and you spread your legs a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.92,0:22:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那派头 那技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that form, that technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拍马都追不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never be that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.44,0:22:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我叫朱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Jody, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.96,0:22:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎德拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kendra.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.44,0:22:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也要试试吗 - 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you going to try out? - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我不知道 我喜欢跳舞 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't know. I mean, I like to dance, but I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.60,0:22:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢成为视线的焦点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like to be the center of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下一个 - 哦 好吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, who's next? - Oh, food.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.60,0:22:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉我第一次见识到了芭蕾的真谛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is as if I am seeing ballet for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.52,0:22:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算哪门子芭蕾\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not ballet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.24,0:22:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种激情 这种感官享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}The passion, the sensuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.64,0:22:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个臀部让人想钻进去然后一辈子不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}An ass that makes you want to crawl inside and take up residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.08,0:23:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也能跳得有激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can show passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢耶 噢耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, oh, yeah, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪确实很努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody certainly had her work cut out for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但坎德拉那个小妞简直性感到爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Kendra chick was smokin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.52,0:23:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收欧元吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you accept euros?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西 莉莉 艾丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathy, Lily, Aidan?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朱迪 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jody? - Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.40,0:24:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 亲爱的 太对不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sweetie, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.48,0:24:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so sorry. - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,锅竟然在地板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是螺丝松了 我会修的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, probably a screw loose. I'll fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.20,0:24:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉房间里有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like there's something in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.88,0:24:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.04,0:24:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉脖子后有一股暖湿腐烂的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I feel hot, clammy, foul-smelling breath on my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.68,0:24:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要给灵媒打电话 驱驱鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need call psychic. Kill bad spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 不 玛利亚 别再来这一套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ugh. - No, Maria, enough of this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.44,0:24:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我来祷告 我来保护这个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, then I do blessing, I protect house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you really need to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.56,0:24:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是带孩子累着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just stressed out about the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.60,0:24:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是这个房子的问题 我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's this house. I… I feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.60,0:24:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有玛利亚不太正常 说实话 你相信她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Maria's a little off. I mean, honestly do you really trust her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.08,0:24:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 不别担心 她连一个苍蝇都不忍心杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey, don't worry, she couldn't hurt a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.52,0:24:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明天还有正事要做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you have a big day ahead of you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.44,0:24:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们赶紧休息吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get you some sleep, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.60,0:24:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.04,0:25:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信 我们的房子竟然被抢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this… our whole house ransacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.76,0:25:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没关门就走了 家里也没人看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave the house unattended with the doors unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.20,0:25:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看家都什么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and look what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.64,0:25:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没丢 只是有人故意捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't take anything. It's just vandalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.52,0:25:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了孩子们的房间没事 其他的都被祸害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every room except the kids' rooms was trashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.92,0:25:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说你觉得是孩子们干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you suspect the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.08,0:25:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是麻麻 麻麻干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Mama. Mama did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.56,0:25:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她恨这个房子 她恨你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hates this house. She hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.20,0:25:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛利亚 这是摄像机 必要的全天录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Maria, this is camera. Necesito filming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.12,0:25:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮我收拾 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for helping me clean up, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.16,0:25:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嘿 我找这个找了一大圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, been looking all over for this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.12,0:25:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是威风不减当年啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got it…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 天啊 救命啊 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry! God, help, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.68,0:25:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛利亚 亲爱的 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria, honey, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.62,0:25:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 玛利亚 把摄像机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez! Maria, put the camera…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.40,0:25:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候我妈训练我的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom coaching me when I was a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.72,0:25:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总是实施内疚策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw… Always applying the guilt trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.40,0:25:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我得到了领舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That got me the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.84,0:25:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:25:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛利亚 看我找到了什么 这是啥呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria, look what I found. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那 那是个新型的电动牙刷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, that's… a new type of electric toothbrush.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.24,0:26:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,震动能把你的牙垢除掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibrations knock the tartar off your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.36,0:26:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看 这有一大盒子的电动牙刷 - 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, a whole box of toothbrushes. - Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.00,0:26:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个黑色的好大啊 - 行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This black one is huge. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.32,0:26:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看 这还有个两头的 - 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And look, here's a double-sided one. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.04,0:26:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个还能绑在我脑袋上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one that I can strap on to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.24,0:26:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 放这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Put that over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.52,0:26:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹叔叔 这是什么 带珠子的牙线吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Dan, what is this? Beaded floss?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.48,0:26:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个成年人用的牙线 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's grown-up floss, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.76,0:26:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我涂鸦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graffiti!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.52,0:26:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.76,0:26:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁画的 我们怎么 玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who does that? What are we… Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.08,0:26:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛利亚 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.12,0:26:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪小姐 朱迪小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Jody, Miss Jody,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.63,0:26:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给这个人打电话 布莱恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}you call this man… Mr. Blaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.92,0:26:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮了我的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.08,0:26:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是个灵媒 - 对 他会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a psychic. - Si, he'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.64,0:26:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们真正需要的是更多的安保摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what we really need are more security cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.60,0:26:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹叔叔 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Dan. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.25,0:26:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些牙刷长的可真像假阳具啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}these toothbrushes look an awful lot like dildos.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.24,0:27:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.08,0:28:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好玩 麻麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is fun, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.12,0:28:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还没睡啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.72,0:28:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 听着 丹叔叔出院前\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, guys, it's just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.08,0:28:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们几个在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}until Uncle Dan comes back from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.96,0:28:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这样 你们也不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it, you don't like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.50,0:28:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是我不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.44,0:28:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去睡觉 我明天还要起早练芭蕾呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go to sleep. I have to be up early for ballet tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.04,0:28:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很喜欢芭蕾是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really like ballet, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.86,0:28:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但我不想让你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I don't want you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.56,0:28:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:28:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻麻说你会出意外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama says you're going to have an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.04,0:29:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 是那个祸害了房子的麻麻说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, OK. Is this the same Mama who trashed the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.36,0:29:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,本质上说 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.48,0:29:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.96,0:29:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没打算进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.12,0:29:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.52,0:29:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的房子 我想进就进\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my house, I can if I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.36,0:29:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你我就不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.68,0:29:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就进 - 不许进\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would. - Wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.52,0:29:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就进 - 不许进\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would, too. - Would not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.52,0:29:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着 我才是成年人 你命令不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm the adult. You're not the boss of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.68,0:29:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.40,0:29:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你别让人进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to let anyone in!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.56,0:30:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是朱迪就\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so Jody was…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.44,0:30:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊 我能闻到那个味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, I just smelled that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.04,0:30:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,熏死我了 我的妈呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just got to me, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.20,0:30:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是朱迪就\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so Jody was…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.96,0:30:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 受不了了 对不起 失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I… I'm sorry, you have to excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.12,0:30:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得呼吸点新鲜空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.40,0:30:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一节你们自己看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next section should explain itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.96,0:30:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.88,0:30:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一句话不重复第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not wish to repeat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.68,0:30:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重复一遍 我一句话不重复第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, I do not wish to repeat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.44,0:30:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我戴上那个像个围巾一样的毛衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I require the sweater I wear as a scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.28,0:30:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 真舒服 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Comfortable, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.76,0:30:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 别这样 我在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm… Mother, please, I am working.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.80,0:30:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 因为海瑟·达尔西太老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, because Heather Darcy is so old, this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.44,0:30:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一季我们需要选一个新的天鹅皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will have a new Swan Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.40,0:30:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人就是朱迪·桑德斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that person is Jody Sanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.56,0:31:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 朱迪给大家展示一下你的才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Jody, show us your routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.28,0:31:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是天鹅皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm the Swan Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.96,0:31:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch me. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.92,0:31:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚说了 我选择的新\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I was saying, my choice for new…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.84,0:31:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 是谁都不能是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her?! Anyone but her!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.12,0:31:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不如选那个扫地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might just as well have picked the janitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.00,0:31:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾拉 别闹了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ira, please, not now. OK. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.80,0:31:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 这是个艰难的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it was a difficult decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.96,0:31:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一直很喜欢朱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have always been attracted to Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.92,0:31:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么能不喜欢她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.81,0:31:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有着五年级小男孩的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has the body of a fifth-grade boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.08,0:31:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 如果她一旦不能演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the event that she is unable to dance,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.16,0:31:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我任命坎德拉·布鲁克斯作为替补演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am naming as her understudy Kendra Brooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.48,0:31:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 该吃午饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.00,0:32:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 房子真不错 我去找女孩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, this is a nice house. I'm gonna go find the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.00,0:32:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西 你是怎么知道我今天跳芭蕾会出意外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathy, how did you know I was going to have an accident today at the ballet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.16,0:32:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻麻告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.44,0:32:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那麻麻是怎么知道我会出意外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, well, how did Mama know I was going to have an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.52,0:32:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你在这啊 我在头上找到了一个绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there you are. I found this bandage on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.88,0:32:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 别闹 我觉得这个房子里有蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, please. I think there is something going on in this house,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.00,0:32:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个叫麻麻的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}something about this Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.44,0:32:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给玛利亚告诉我们的那个灵媒打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna call the psychic Maria told us about.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.36,0:32:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪 你真的觉得我们需要灵媒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody, do you really think we need a psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.16,0:32:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹叔叔 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Dan, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.36,0:32:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来了 - 我要给你看些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coming. - I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.68,0:32:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹叔叔 麻麻教了我一些小把戏 看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Dan, Mama taught me some tricks. Look what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.76,0:32:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 真厉害 亲爱的 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, wow, that's really good, honey. - Dada.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.20,0:32:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿爹你个娘咧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.00,0:32:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹叔叔 看我 - 恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uncle Dan, look at me. - Evil spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.40,0:32:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 丹先生 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Mr. Dan, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.88,0:32:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个不是朱迪的泳衣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that one of Jody's bathing suits?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正面对着人类无法想象的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're facing something our human minds cannot imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.04,0:33:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.44,0:33:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们还是给你找个浴袍穿上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you in a robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.72,0:33:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道我今天芭蕾练得怎么样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to hear about the ballet today?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.24,0:33:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻麻在帮我们准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama's helping us get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.00,0:33:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好 那我也刷牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, OK, I'll brush, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.96,0:33:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦 我的牙刷去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm. Where did my toothbrush go?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.92,0:33:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 不许舔自己的蛋蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we don't lick our balls in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.56,0:33:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不会再有下次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.52,0:33:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管朱迪怎么努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try as she might,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.12,0:33:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都无法和孩子们交心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody just couldn't seem to connect with those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.44,0:33:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也无法除掉她嘴里那个牙刷的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or get the taste of that toothbrush out of her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.24,0:33:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是八岁儿童的青春期焦虑在作怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it just eight-year-old teen angst,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.04,0:33:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是有其他世界的力量在煽风点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}or were there otherworldly forces at work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.84,0:35:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Baby. - Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.36,0:35:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 我听见一些声音 - 什么声\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Babe, I heard something. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.68,0:35:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉厨房有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's someone in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.88,0:35:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 根本没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? There's nobody down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.76,0:35:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了 就在那 去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is again! Right there. Go look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.04,0:35:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪 冷静点 看 没什么可担心的 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody, calm down. See, there's nothing to worry about. It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.28,0:35:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.88,0:35:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 我给那个灵媒打电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, I'm calling the psychic!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.68,0:35:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Make the call!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.72,0:35:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩·福尔达 专业灵媒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blaine Fulda, professional psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.72,0:35:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是朱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.20,0:35:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 你好 - 这是我的丈夫丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Indeed you are. - Yes. And this is my husband Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.76,0:35:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,按你的要求 酬劳是500美金的匿名汇票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your payment as requested. $500 in unmarked bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.76,0:35:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你认识玛利亚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course, you know Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.72,0:35:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 布莱恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hola, Mr. Blaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.84,0:35:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 玛利亚 你妹妹还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Maria. How's your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.40,0:35:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了 恶魔杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead. Demon kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.76,0:35:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 怪不得打电话没人接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that explains the unreturned phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.72,0:35:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到了邪恶的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sensing evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.40,0:35:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得拿一些你们的私人物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to get some of your personal belongings here,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.48,0:35:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查一下不散的恶魔和鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so I can check for demon and ghost residue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.28,0:35:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人抬不了那么多监视器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna be able to lift all those monitors,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.64,0:35:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但明天我会让我表弟开白色货车过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'll send my cousin tomorrow with the white van.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.66,0:35:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能把监视器都放进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can get them in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.00,0:35:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚丹被厨房给袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan was attacked by the kitchen last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.96,0:36:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们觉得可能是麻麻干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think it might be Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.59,0:36:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,厨房袭击人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitchen attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.56,0:36:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该早点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've said that earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.24,0:36:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果房间找你的麻烦 那不是鬼魂就是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a room turns on you, it's either a ghost or a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.16,0:36:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔可以操控人吗 比如说 活在他们体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can a demon take over someone? Like, live within them?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.76,0:36:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 挺瘆人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, that's some scary shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.32,0:36:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以恶魔是最糟糕的情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a demon is about the worst thing you can have?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.64,0:36:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 夫人 性病是最糟糕的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, ma'am, an STD is the worst thing that you can have.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.52,0:36:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有谁想伤害你们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you know who wants to hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.51,0:36:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有妒忌你的同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a jealous colleague at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.16,0:36:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是被你忽略的脸书朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Facebook friend you might have ignored?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.28,0:36:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你领养了一个名叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you adopted a small African child.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.74,0:36:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊卡塔巴布韦的非洲小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}named Ikatababwe,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.52,0:36:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应了每天给这个黑鬼二十五美分的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}promising to feed this nigga for 25 cents a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.76,0:36:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他也需要喝水啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then he needs something to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.20,0:36:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总之 咱们开始吧 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anyway, let's begin. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.68,0:36:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个魔鬼交流器\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the evil communicator.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.20,0:36:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上它 我就能进入另一个次元\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I put this on, I'll be able to cross over to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.28,0:36:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟邪恶的一方对峙 这会立即引发\N{\fnArial\fs30}and confront the entity. That will immediately trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.80,0:36:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的350美元费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}the final $350 payment of.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.98,0:36:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,用于迪莎·福尔达的抚养费\N{\fnArial\fs30}child support to Tisha Fulda.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.52,0:36:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你们手握手 闭上眼 集中思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you guys would just join hands, close eyes and concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.96,0:36:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱散心中的烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Empty your mind of all the thoughts of today's troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.36,0:36:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,将所有一切都抛诸脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that went on, get that out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.96,0:36:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,专注于精神世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}is all about the spirit world here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.32,0:37:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And three, two and one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么了 这些东西自己动起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? Things are starting to move all by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.08,0:37:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe! Breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.84,0:37:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我觉着他没法呼吸呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I don't think he can breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.07,0:37:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是专业的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.80,0:37:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有这么一套精细复杂的装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sophisticated piece of equipment like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.61,0:37:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然可以呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he can breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.84,0:37:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠 我没法呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, I couldn't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.32,0:37:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点害死自己了 好啦 我沟通过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost killed myself. All right, I communicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.20,0:37:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这绝对有一个恶魔 - 额滴神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was definitely a demon. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.88,0:37:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我错了 这是个幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I was wrong. It's a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.56,0:37:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量非常强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}So strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.80,0:37:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.76,0:37:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我 他缠上我了 丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help, it's got me! Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.12,0:37:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.72,0:37:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,太太 你快离开这 这是个魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, you got to get out of here. It's evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.74,0:37:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,十足的魔鬼 她叫麻麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pure evil! It's Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.76,0:38:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你相信这里有些不对劲了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now do you believe that something's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.60,0:38:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被拖走了 嘴里还叫着「麻麻」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got dragged away, yelling out, "Mama."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.08,0:38:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被拖走了吗 我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got dragged away? I don't remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.24,0:38:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹你当时昏过去了 - 这我也不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dan, you were unconscious. - I don't remember that, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.68,0:38:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 亲爱的 我不是想吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, honey, I don't want to argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.36,0:38:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是我们彼此相爱 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The important thing is, we love each other, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.52,0:38:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 重点是可能真的有麻麻这个幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the important thing is that this Mama thing could be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.04,0:38:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她还想杀掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she might be trying to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.80,0:38:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小朱 那家伙是个骗子 仅此而已 好嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jod, that guy was a fraud and that's it. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.72,0:38:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 我的鸡鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - My penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.08,0:38:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是的 - 就是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.28,0:38:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就在那儿 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, right now, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.96,0:38:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的 在努力呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.64,0:38:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那到底是什么 - 我的鸡鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is that? - My penis?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.84,0:38:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's making that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.16,0:39:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.32,0:40:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的鸡鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}MY penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.96,0:40:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有烟味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.00,0:40:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛利亚你在干嘛 你会把房子烧掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria! What are you doing?! You're gonna burn down the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.04,0:40:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在杀恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill bad spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.36,0:40:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了这是 - 玛利亚差点把房子烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is going on? - Maria almost burned the house down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.00,0:40:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 神马 - 的确如此 她有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - That's it, she's got…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.36,0:40:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 这全都失控了 你把大家都吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! This is getting out of hand. You're scaring everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.08,0:41:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能解雇她 她陪伴我们很多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't fire her. I mean, she's been with us for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.28,0:41:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.76,0:41:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这是歧视 - 好吧 这又是神马玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's discrimination. - OK, now what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这太扯了 - 这是她的信仰 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is completely insane! - It's what she believes in, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.52,0:41:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.80,0:41:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要赶我走啊 你家不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna let me go?! Your family is not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.80,0:41:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起玛利亚 这样下去是不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Maria, it's just not working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.08,0:41:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的建议是别带孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a recommendation, just nothing involving kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.96,0:41:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者住在靠我们一英里的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}or within a mile of anyone's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.16,0:41:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在这样了 我得去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this anymore. I got to go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.04,0:41:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂你在说什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even understand what you're saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.96,0:42:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.08,0:42:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.84,0:42:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去两年 我们的丹·桑德斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the past two years, our own Dan Sanders has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.76,0:42:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在三十只猿猴上测试I-13药剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}testing the I-13 compound on 30 apes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.60,0:42:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 其中二十九变成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, 29 of them turned into.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.04,0:42:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神错乱暴躁易怒的变态性捕食者\N{\fnArial\fs30}insane, aggressive, deviant sexual predators.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.80,0:42:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是只有凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one, Caesar,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.96,0:42:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在智力方面有了长足的进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}has experienced a huge leap in intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.20,0:42:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正同时应对三个对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he plays three opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.56,0:42:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然对手都是猿猴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, they're apes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.08,0:42:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但凯撒的超凡能力归功于一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Caesar's superior capabilities are the work of one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.04,0:42:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是I-13项目的研发人 丹·桑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brains behind the I-13 project, Dan San…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.72,0:42:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧 - 我没事 马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you OK? - I'm fine, Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.24,0:42:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 请允许我向你们介绍凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, I'd like to introduce you to Caesar…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.80,0:42:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甩不掉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not getting away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.20,0:42:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oof!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.36,0:42:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.32,0:43:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,百老汇街大的交通处于停滞状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traffic is backed up on the Broad Street Bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.68,0:43:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方在那里和一群猿猴进行枪战\N{\fnArial\fs30}where apparently police are battling dozens of apes in a running gunfight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.32,0:43:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,据报道 一家实验室的一位科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our reports indicate that a scientist at a research laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.52,0:43:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给这些猿猴服用了实验性的开智药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}gave these apes an experimental intelligence drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.60,0:43:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有警务人员都赶到了现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm being told that all available officers are now on the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.28,0:43:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但此时我们建议所有观众绕道而行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at this time, we are advising all our viewers to find alternate routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.56,0:43:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚得知我们有一通求救电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm now being told we have the actual 911 call.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.52,0:43:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒了警方情势的严重性\N{\fnArial\fs30}that first alerted the police to the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.88,0:43:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是911 你遇到了什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}911, what's your emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.28,0:43:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 猿猴闯进房子里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Apes are inside the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.04,0:43:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 女士 发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, ma'am. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.36,0:43:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时正在做爱 哦天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were making love and… Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.44,0:43:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在攻击他 - 在攻击谁 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're attacking him! - Who are they attacking, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.56,0:43:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 天哪 快救救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl! Oh, my God! Please, help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.36,0:43:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你老公在哪里 - 卡尔不是我老公\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is your husband right now? - Carl's not my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.72,0:43:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老公是十二频道新闻节目主持人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband's the anchor for Channel 12 News.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.28,0:43:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能知道这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.56,0:43:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 女士 但我们需要 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, ma'am, but we need to… - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.32,0:44:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁我丈夫还在录节目快派人来支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send help while my husband's still on the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.44,0:44:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 这不重要 重要的是你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, that's not important. Your life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.00,0:44:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 你说得对 他干嘛在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right. Why should he care?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.24,0:44:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我敢肯定他和搭档的那个小贱人睡过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm pretty sure he's been sleeping with his co-anchor, that bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.64,0:44:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把她撕个粉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm gonna rip her…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.44,0:44:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.56,0:44:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道是你 你如此完美 呆板\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it was gonna be you. You're just so perfect, so mechanical.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.16,0:44:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你跳舞就像看机器人跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching you dance is like watching a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.88,0:44:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.32,0:44:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.68,0:44:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这么多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.69,0:44:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮埃尔有体重限制要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pierre has a weight limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.20,0:44:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太胖了 你看玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm too heavy. Look at Mara.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.16,0:44:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起来多棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.08,0:44:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, are you sure you're OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.36,0:44:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里发生了奇怪的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird things have been happening at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.00,0:44:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西说会有意外发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathy said there was going to be an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.36,0:44:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后海瑟就发生了意外 - 这很严重的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then it happened to Heather. - That's some serious shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.44,0:44:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该和孩子们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should talk to those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.80,0:44:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 是比萨耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.60,0:45:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不停的吃可就是不长胖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I eat and eat and eat, and I don't gain a pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.92,0:45:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,海瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.96,0:45:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为可以取代我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can replace me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.64,0:45:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那我们等着看天鹅怎么吞噬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll see how you like it once the swan consumes you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.84,0:45:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.32,0:45:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,破门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.96,0:45:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈了个巴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.56,0:46:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道原来你这么会搭东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I didn't know you were such a good builder.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.92,0:46:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.48,0:46:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西 我希望你告诉我关于麻麻的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathy, I want you to tell me about Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.72,0:46:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻麻不喜欢别人谈论她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama doesn't like it when you talk about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.88,0:46:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.12,0:46:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是邪恶之书里读过的一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a woman who read from an evil book.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.52,0:46:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候她会进入我们的梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes she comes to us in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.00,0:46:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.12,0:46:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 当然在梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your dreams, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.44,0:46:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我能知晓你的梦境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could see what's inside your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.00,0:46:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,来提取你的梦 来个盗梦空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}To extract what's in your dreams. To perform an inception.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.52,0:46:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能别动它 这个大号是我出生的时候吹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you drop that? That's my birth tuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.00,0:46:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是多姆·寇伯 你要入梦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I'm Dom Kolb. You called about a dream extraction?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.16,0:46:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我要找一本邪恶之术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I need to find out about an evil book.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.08,0:46:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个机器可以让我们进入梦境\N{\fnArial\fs30}This machine will allow us access to the dream world.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.92,0:46:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.56,0:46:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们什么时候开始做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when do we start dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.32,0:46:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会记得梦的开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never really remember the beginning of a dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.12,0:46:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吧 - 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- do you? - I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.52,0:47:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.60,0:47:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你在共享梦境里的第一课 保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is your first lesson in shared dreaming. Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.44,0:47:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我把手机丢这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I dropped my phone in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.24,0:47:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要清除所有的潜意识 注意你所想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to clear your subconscious. And watch what you think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.76,0:47:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要太疯狂 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing crazy. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.16,0:47:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如你胯下着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like having your crotch burst into flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.96,0:47:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和麻麻有什么关…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that have to do with Ma…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.36,0:47:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.80,0:47:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.16,0:47:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是朱迪·桑德斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Jody Sanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.28,0:47:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 亲爱的 我正在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my dear. I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.52,0:47:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.52,0:47:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都叫我克里斯蒂安·格雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call me Christian Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.32,0:47:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢我蓝色的房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you like my blue room?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.36,0:48:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是红的 - 哦 我是色盲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's red. - Oh. I'm color-blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.48,0:48:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的装潢师答应过我 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My decorator assured me that… Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.56,0:48:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝香槟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champagne?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.52,0:48:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.28,0:48:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站着就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.44,0:48:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 克里斯蒂安 天啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Christian, man, golly, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.68,0:48:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要好好谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to thank you a lot, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.00,0:48:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我趴在那里就像个吊球一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}for working on my prostrate like it was a speed bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.48,0:48:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 迈克尔我得承认我对你的表现也很惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Michael, I must admit, I was surprised at your performance, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.60,0:48:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于一个过气超重脸上纹身的人来说不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad for a washed-up, overweight, facially tattooed…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.68,0:48:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.32,0:48:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.00,0:48:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what that one was.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.36,0:48:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.20,0:48:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻麻 你在这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama, are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.48,0:48:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多姆 是你吗 - 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dom, is that you? - Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.24,0:49:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过梦想我们一起慢慢变老\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you'd had a dream that we'd grow old together.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.68,0:49:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. And we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.56,0:49:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这干嘛 - 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.76,0:49:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能带她来这 我们的孩子怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you bring her here? What about our children?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.00,0:49:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是不存在 - 不 他们是的 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're not real. - Yes, they are. Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.72,0:49:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯，裴丽帕\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, Phillippa!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.36,0:49:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会要跳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna jump, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.12,0:49:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么没想到 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hadn't thought about that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.88,0:49:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一点进展也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, we're not getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.08,0:49:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些和凯西有毛线关系啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does any of this have to do with Kathy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.72,0:49:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西 我以为你就是凯西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathy? I thought you were Kathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.88,0:49:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.84,0:50:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,葵花点穴手\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Gort Klaatu Barada Nikto."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.56,0:50:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.52,0:50:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那肯定是她 - 麻麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That must have been her. - Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.72,0:50:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想带我们回悬崖\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to take us home to the cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.96,0:50:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么意思 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does that mean? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.92,0:50:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想你会给我好评的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I trust you'll give me a favorable Yelp review?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.04,0:50:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪的任务很明确了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody's mission was clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.64,0:50:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造出麻麻的邪恶之书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The evil book that created Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.72,0:50:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在森林里一个木屋的地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}was located in the cellar of a cabin, in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.44,0:50:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她能找到那个木屋 她就能知道答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she could find that cabin, maybe she could find some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.72,0:50:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能找到那个木屋 我们就能知道答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can find that cabin, maybe we can find some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.96,0:50:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 淡定 我来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, calm down. I'm gonna come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.56,0:51:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坎德拉 - 干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kendra? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.72,0:51:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, wait, what's going on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.80,0:51:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她就在楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she's out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.64,0:51:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急别急 淡定\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, OK, just… you stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.92,0:51:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,前门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Front door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.16,0:51:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她进来了 - 前门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's in the house! - Front door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.44,0:51:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 镇定… - 前门已开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, stay… - Front door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.76,0:51:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的给我关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.32,0:51:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need for that, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.12,0:51:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贱人 - 前门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bitch?! - Front door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.16,0:51:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你居然敢叫我贱人 - 前门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you did not just call me a bitch! - Front door open…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.64,0:51:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 - 丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey? - Dan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.20,0:51:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不知道是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry. I didn't know who you were and…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.36,0:51:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 亲爱的 只是巧合 对吧 凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, honey, it was an accident. Right, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.24,0:51:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然他可以留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course he can stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.16,0:51:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看 凯撒想帮忙做点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that. Caesar wants to help out around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.52,0:51:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.12,0:51:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.36,0:51:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 只是我突然看见只大猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I see an ape,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.04,0:51:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是本能反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come out swinging.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.88,0:52:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.12,0:52:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.80,0:52:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很开心看到你没事 但今晚就是个警示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so glad you're OK, but tonight was a wake-up call.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.92,0:52:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们找到了那间小屋 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we've got to find that cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.36,0:52:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到了一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.88,0:52:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们炒了玛利亚 谁来照顾孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, we fired Maria. Who's gonna watch the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.48,0:52:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.32,0:52:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 淘气保姆来啦 - 见到你很开心 淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Naughty Nanny's here. - Nice to meet you, Naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.20,0:52:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的妻子朱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my wife Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.54,0:52:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,3P呀 那可要额外收费哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Threesome? That costs extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.32,0:52:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 还有只猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus. Monkey, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.20,0:52:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是些什么怪人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you people are freaks,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.25,0:52:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过另付一百美元就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but for an extra $100.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.28,0:52:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是叫了哪家机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}What agency did you call?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.80,0:52:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们提供护士 拉拉队 还有保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they have nurses and cheerleaders and nannies.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.52,0:52:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 你叫的这是三陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, you called an escort service.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.96,0:52:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们上次我叫圣诞老人的那家机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used the same agency to book a Santa for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.84,0:52:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在召唤圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone called for Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.64,0:52:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嚯嚯嚯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ho, ho, ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.00,0:52:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 你来照看孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, you're watching the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.60,0:53:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪对小屋感到很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody was nervous about what she might find at the cabin,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.08,0:53:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有凯撒和闺蜜们当得力助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she was comforted by the fact.
