Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.60,1:02:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要一只右手 - 埃里克锯掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need a right. - Eric chainsawed it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.28,1:02:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我错了 - 我的 我的腿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I'm sorry. - My… My leg?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.72,1:02:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那条是黑的 不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's black. It's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.24,1:02:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈的 - 我都不知道该怎么办了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - I don't know what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.00,1:02:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲伤逆流成河\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, cry me a river.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.00,1:02:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮助 我想上厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need a little help. I have to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.32,1:02:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我的弟弟在那角落里 - 太操蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My penis is in the corner. - This is fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.12,1:02:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.48,1:02:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,葵花点穴手\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Gort Klaatu Barada Nikto."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.20,1:02:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.64,1:03:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.54,1:03:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那里有扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, there's a door right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.44,1:03:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go out this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.92,1:03:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 这样就不用走那些奇怪的楼梯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, cool, we can avoid the weirdos upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.52,1:03:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们会逮到你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We're gonna get you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.16,1:03:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们会偷看 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Not another peep ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.00,1:03:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,葵花点穴手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gort Klaatu Barada Nikto. Gort Klaatu Barada Nikto.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.24,1:03:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在从小屋回家的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kendra and I recited the Latin words over and over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.80,1:03:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和坎德拉一遍又一遍重复着这些拉丁文\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the cabin and on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.04,1:03:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说了几百遍 还是什么都没发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must have said it a hundred times, but nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.00,1:03:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会不会不是我们要找的那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it isn't the right book?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.36,1:03:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许葵花点穴手已经被锁定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the curse has somehow been lifted.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.68,1:03:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对丹和朱迪来说 幸运的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luckily for Dan and Jody, there was someone in the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.20,1:03:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了I-13配方\N{\fnArial\fs30}who, thanks to the I-13 formula,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.68,1:03:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里有人的智力和认知能力大大提升\N{\fnArial\fs30}had increased intelligence and superior cognitive ability.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.64,1:03:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的问题解决能力让他\N{\fnArial\fs30}His analytical problem-solving skills allowed him…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.36,1:03:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够探查出重要信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to ascertain crucial information.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.32,1:03:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个现代科学的奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A marvel of modern-day science,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.15,1:03:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的智商甚至超过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}his IQ had surpassed even the most…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.44,1:03:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.68,1:04:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么会觉得你有智力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did I think you could be intelligent?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.76,1:04:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个蠢猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing but a dumb animal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.92,1:04:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.44,1:04:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.68,1:04:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能讲人话了 - 嗨 凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can talk. - Hey, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.60,1:04:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.76,1:04:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹家有个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan's got a mad demon in his house.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.20,1:04:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马特·达蒙在他家 - 不是 是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Matt Damon's in his house? - No, a mad demon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.48,1:04:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死马特·达蒙 杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love Matt Damon. Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.72,1:04:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.60,1:05:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就该知道不该把这个野猩猩带回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have known not to bring a wild animal into the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.92,1:05:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我真的抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.68,1:05:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾相信凯撒 我以为他与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I believed in Caesar. I thought he was different.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.88,1:05:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情可能没有这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something more to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.16,1:05:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能感觉得到 - 不 他就是抽风了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can feel it. - No, he just… went crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.72,1:05:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 但是我还是觉得麻麻在这屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. But I still think Mama could be in this house.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.20,1:05:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不觉得 - 我们花费了一个晚上找些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But don't you… - We just had a whole night go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.12,1:05:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毫无征兆的东西 - 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- without a single sign of anything. - I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是昨晚被孩子们吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just so scared last night for the kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.96,1:05:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要醒醒脑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming around.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.00,1:05:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是喜欢上她们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I getting attached to them?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.68,1:06:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是梦里的那个悬崖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the cliff from the dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.12,1:06:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进车 别逼我骂娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car now. Don't make me yell!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.08,1:06:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 撒旦 我会用这些孩子向您献祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unto thee, Satan, I sacrifice these children.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.84,1:06:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来到悬崖边的老家 完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return home to the cliff of… Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.16,1:06:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,家就在悬崖 天哪 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home is at the cliff. Oh, my God. Girls!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.64,1:06:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西 没事了 我看见悬崖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathy. It's OK. I saw the cliff.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.88,1:06:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道家的意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what "home" means.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.40,1:06:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.12,1:06:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们快来 我们去接艾丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girls. Let's go get Aidan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.72,1:06:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.72,1:06:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉 走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.96,1:06:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丹 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aidan! Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.80,1:07:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹叔叔 丹叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Dan! Uncle Dan!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.68,1:07:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是麻麻 麻麻 麻麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama! Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.32,1:07:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.60,1:07:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们别急 一个个来 莉莉 你先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Girls, girls, girls. One at a time. Lily, you first.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.80,1:07:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 凯西到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. Now Kathy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.24,1:07:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是麻麻 麻麻 她在这 她要杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama! Mama! She's here! She's gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.84,1:07:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你们多少次这世上没有这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to tell everyone there's no such thing as…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.12,1:08:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛利亚 你怎么会在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.88,1:08:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很生气你炒了我鱿鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was angry you fire me,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.37,1:08:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我烤了个这个给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I bake you this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.08,1:08:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,屎派\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shit pie?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.36,1:08:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 但是 - 再来根热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, thanks, but… - Hot dog?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.20,1:08:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 这还是芥末屎味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's still shit with mustard.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.48,1:08:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那来跟香蕉 营养操鸡好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe just a banana, then? Very much potassium.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.92,1:08:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错吧 丹先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So bueno, Mr. Dan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.60,1:08:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我应该相信你说的话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I… I'm sorry. I should have listened to you…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.04,1:08:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹先生 我们有过过节 但是我是爱你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Dan, we have our problems, but I always love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.60,1:08:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很爱很爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.60,1:08:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你 就像见到我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I see you, I see my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.88,1:08:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 丹 我们得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan. Dan, we have to…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.36,1:08:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 发生了什么 - 我能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. What's going on here? - I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.28,1:09:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 麻麻抓走了孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time. Mama has the girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.56,1:09:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她带去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where she took them.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.56,1:09:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.44,1:09:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我想起了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remind me of my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.12,1:09:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.76,1:09:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,得知孩子们有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing the girls were in danger,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.80,1:09:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹和朱迪快马加鞭 往悬崖赶去 他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan and Jody sped off, racing to get to the cliff they…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.20,1:09:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦 他们的车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. What happened to the car?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.56,1:09:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪了 哦 在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? Oh, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.16,1:09:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会眼睁睁得看着那女鬼跳下悬崖\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were no longer able to sit idly by and let a ghost jump off a cliff,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.64,1:09:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用他们的孩子殉葬 - 凯西 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- sacrificing their children with her. - Kathy! Lily!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.36,1:09:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 她们在那 凯西 莉莉快停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. There they are. Kathy, Lily, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.88,1:09:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么办 - 我只要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do we do now? - Um, I'll just…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.16,1:09:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,吟诵这本书上的葵花点穴手换回她的人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}…read from this and change her back to human.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.72,1:09:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们快跑 快跑啊 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls, run! Run! No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.32,1:09:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 方向错了 往悬崖反方向跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not that way. Away from the cliff!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.36,1:09:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再让麻麻带走你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to let Mama take you away again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.72,1:09:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.16,1:10:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉停下 来这嘛 好姑娘 到这来 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily, stop! Come on. Come on. Here, girl. Come on, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.40,1:10:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 看 什么好东西耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Look. Oh, look. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.64,1:10:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这 瞧瞧这个 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Look. Oh, yeah. Lily.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.56,1:10:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢耶 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.64,1:10:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.92,1:10:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 疯够了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.88,1:10:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉不是小狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily's not a dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.64,1:10:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是那个我慢慢喜欢上的小美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a beautiful little girl who I've grown to love.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.28,1:10:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱这些孩子 麻麻 即使他们不都爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love all these children, Mama, even if they don't all love me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.92,1:10:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉也爱你 朱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily loves you, too, Jody.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.28,1:10:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们属于我和丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they belong in this world with me and Dan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.00,1:10:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们值得拥有有血有肉的家长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they deserve parents who aren't decomposing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.64,1:10:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.32,1:10:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.56,1:10:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪一页来着 完了 找不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the page? Damn it, I can't find it.
